flowchart TD
    Start[API Request Ingress] --> CheckRedis{Is Redis Online?}
    
    CheckRedis -- Yes --> ExecLimiter[Execute Redis Rate Limiter & Cache]
    CheckRedis -- Connection Error --> LogWarning[Log Warning: Redis Offline]
    
    LogWarning --> BypassCache[Bypass Cache / Skip Limiter]
    ExecLimiter --> CheckDB{Is PostgreSQL Available?}
    BypassCache --> CheckDB
    
    CheckDB -- Yes --> ExecPostgres[Execute Query via asyncpg / AsyncSession]
    CheckDB -- Connection Error / In-Memory Mode --> CheckSQLite{Use SQLite In-Memory Fallback?}
    
    CheckSQLite -- Yes --> ExecSQLite[Execute Query via aiosqlite]
    CheckSQLite -- No --> Raise500[Raise LogInsertionException -> HTTP 500]
    
    ExecPostgres --> Return200[Return HTTP 200 Response]
    ExecSQLite --> Return200
